  "body": "Joshua, following up on question 2. Let \\(L_{70}\\) be the exact side of the published 70-square construction. The attached certificate gives coordinates for all 179 squares at side \\(L_{70}+5\\). From the algebraic folder, python3 -B verify_roots.py checks containment, pairwise separation and the exact relation between the two sides. Credit for the 179-square construction belongs to Doğa Özden, building on Ryan Xu’s 70-square packing and Evan Daniel’s refinement. My contribution with OpenAI's GPT 6.2 Astra is the algebraic reconstruction and certificate.\n\n[n179-exact-construction.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/35184249/n179-exact-construction.zip)",
